-- 언데드 (디아블로2 네크로맨서 소환): 해골 전사·해골 마법사·되살림. 혼 하나를 소모해 일으킨다.
-- 혼은 한 번만 쓴다 — 해골·되살림·추출·망자 폭쇄 중 하나 (D2의 시체와 같다).
-- 수: D2 규칙 — 스킬 1~3레벨은 레벨만큼, 이후 2 + 레벨/3 (20레벨 8기, undeadCountMax). 꽉 차면 가장 오래된 것이 무너진다.
-- 되살림: 원본 몬스터 그대로 reviveSeconds(180초), 동시 수 = 스킬 레벨 (reviveCountMax 5).
-- 주인이 맵을 옮기면 다시 일으켜 따라오고, 주인이 죽으면 모두 무너진다. 그림자(영구 수집)와 달리 저장하지 않는다.
-- 유닛 엔티티는 그림자와 같은 shadowunit 모델(ShadowUnit, Kind만 다름)을 쓴다.
@Logic
script UndeadSystem extends Logic

    property table Owned = {}            -- userId → { rec, ... } (오래된 순)
    property integer Serial = 0
    property number SoulReach = 1.5      -- 조준점에서 혼을 찾는 거리

    method table Elements()
        return { "fire", "cold", "light", "poison" }
    end

    method integer CountFor(integer slvl)
        -- 해골 전사·마법사 최대 수 (D2): 1, 2, 3, 3, 3, 4, 4, 4, 5 … 20레벨 8
        if slvl <= 0 then return 0 end
        if slvl <= 3 then return slvl end
        return math.min(math.floor(_GameData.undeadCountMax), 2 + math.floor(slvl / 3))
    end

    method integer ReviveCountFor(integer slvl)
        return math.min(math.floor(_GameData.reviveCountMax), slvl)
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method table ListOf(Entity player)
        -- 주인별 목록 (무너진 것은 정리)
        local uid = player.PlayerComponent.UserId
        local list = self.Owned[uid]
        if list == nil then
            list = {}
            self.Owned[uid] = list
        end
        return list
    end

    -- ───────── 일으키기 ─────────

    method SoulOrb FindSoul(Entity player, Vector2 target, number radius)
        -- 다른 사람의 혼·이미 예약된 혼은 건너뛰고 내 혼만 찾는다.
        local best = nil
        local distance = radius
        if not isvalid(player.CurrentMap) then return nil end
        for _, comp in ipairs(player.CurrentMap:GetChildComponentsByTypeName("script.SoulOrb", true)) do
            ---@type SoulOrb
            local orb = comp
            if isvalid(orb.Entity) and orb.Entity.Enable and not orb.Consumed and not orb.Reserved and orb.OwnerUserId == player.PlayerComponent.UserId then
                local d = (_Util:Pos2(orb.Entity) - target):Magnitude()
                if d <= distance then
                    best = orb
                    distance = d
                end
            end
        end
        return best
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method boolean Raise(Entity player, string kind, integer slvl, Vector2 target, any onComplete)
        local userId = player.PlayerComponent.UserId
        local me = _Util:Pos2(player)
        if (target - me):Magnitude() > 5 then
            _Util:Notify("혼이 너무 멀리 있다", userId)
            return false
        end
        local orb = self:FindSoul(player, target, self.SoulReach)
        if orb == nil then
            _Util:Notify("근처에 내 혼이 없다 — 몬스터를 처치한 뒤 소환하세요", userId)
            log("[VRF] summon rejected: no owned soul")
            return false
        end
        if kind == "revive" and (orb.Rank == "unique" or orb.Rank == "boss") then
            _Util:Notify("최상위·보스는 되살릴 수 없다", userId)
            return false
        end
        local pos = _Util:Pos2(orb.Entity)
        local rec = self:MakeRecord(player, kind, slvl, orb)
        orb.Reserved = true
        local finished = false
        local fail = function()
            if finished then return end
            finished = true
            if isvalid(orb.Entity) then orb.Reserved = false end
            self:DestroyEntity(rec)
            if onComplete ~= nil then onComplete(false) end
        end
        local spawned = self:SpawnUnit(player, rec, pos, function()
            if finished then self:DestroyEntity(rec) return end
            if not _Util:IsAlive(player) or not isvalid(orb.Entity) or player.CurrentMap ~= orb.Entity.CurrentMap then fail() return end
            finished = true
            orb:Consume()
            local max = self:CountFor(slvl)
            if kind == "revive" then max = self:ReviveCountFor(slvl) end
            self:TrimOldest(player, kind, max - 1)
            table.insert(self:ListOf(player), rec)
            self:RefreshSummary(player)
            _GameEvents:Emit("UndeadRaised", { player = player, kind = kind })
            if onComplete ~= nil then onComplete(true) end
        end, fail)
        if not spawned then orb.Reserved = false return false end
        _TimerService:SetTimerOnce(function() if not finished then fail() end end, 1)
        return true
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method table MakeRecord(Entity player, string kind, integer slvl, SoulOrb orb)
        -- 일으킬 때 능력치를 확정해 둔다 (맵 이동 때 같은 능력치로 다시 일으킨다)
        self.Serial = self.Serial + 1
        local rec = { id = "ud" .. tostring(self.Serial), kind = kind, expireAt = 0, entity = nil, element = "", ratio = 0 }
        local mastery = 1 + _GameData.skeletonMasteryPct * self:SkillLevel(player, "skeleton_mastery") / 100
        if kind == "skeleton" then
            local m = _GameData:GetMonsterStats("skel_warrior")
            rec.atk = math.floor((_GameData.skeletonAtkBase + _GameData.skeletonAtkPerLv * (slvl - 1)) * mastery)
            rec.hp = math.floor((_GameData.skeletonHpBase + _GameData.skeletonHpPerLv * (slvl - 1)) * mastery)
            rec.cooldown = _GameData.skeletonCooldown
            rec.range = 0.8
            rec.speed = _GameData.skeletonSpeed
            rec.stand = m ~= nil and m.stand or ""
            rec.move = m ~= nil and m.move or ""
            rec.attack = m ~= nil and m.attack or ""
            rec.scale = 0.7
            rec.tint = Color(0.92, 0.9, 0.82, 1)
        elseif kind == "mage" then
            local m = _GameData:GetMonsterStats("skel_warrior")
            local elements = self:Elements()
            rec.element = elements[_UtilLogic:RandomIntegerRange(1, #elements)]
            rec.ratio = 1
            rec.atk = math.floor((_GameData.mageAtkBase + _GameData.mageAtkPerLv * (slvl - 1)) * mastery)
            rec.hp = math.floor((_GameData.mageHpBase + _GameData.mageHpPerLv * (slvl - 1)) * mastery)
            rec.cooldown = _GameData.mageCooldown
            rec.range = _GameData.mageRange
            rec.speed = _GameData.skeletonSpeed
            rec.stand = m ~= nil and m.stand or ""
            rec.move = m ~= nil and m.move or ""
            rec.attack = m ~= nil and m.attack or ""
            rec.scale = 0.7
            rec.tint = self:ElementTint(rec.element)
        else
            -- 되살림: 원본 몬스터 그대로 (그림자 개성 계산을 배율 1로)
            local mul = _GameData.reviveStatMul / _GameData.shadowStatMul
            local prof = _ShadowConfig:GetProfile(orb.SourceId, orb.Grade, orb.Level, mul)
            rec.atk = prof.atk
            rec.hp = prof.hp
            rec.cooldown = prof.cooldown
            rec.range = prof.range
            rec.speed = prof.speed
            rec.element = prof.element
            rec.ratio = prof.ratio
            rec.resists = prof.resists
            rec.stand = orb.StandRUID
            rec.move = orb.MoveRUID
            local source = _GameData:GetMonsterStats(orb.SourceId)
            rec.attack = source ~= nil and source.attack or ""
            rec.scale = 1
            rec.tint = Color(0.6, 1, 0.65, 0.9)
            rec.variant = orb.Variant        -- 되살린 변종 우두머리는 능력도 그대로
            rec.expireAt = _UtilLogic.ElapsedSeconds + _GameData.reviveSeconds
        end
        return rec
    end

    method Color ElementTint(string element)
        if element == "fire" then return Color(1, 0.55, 0.4, 1) end
        if element == "cold" then return Color(0.55, 0.75, 1, 1) end
        if element == "light" then return Color(1, 0.95, 0.5, 1) end
        return Color(0.55, 1, 0.5, 1)
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method void TrimOldest(Entity player, string kind, integer keep)
        -- kind가 keep 개를 넘으면 가장 오래된 것부터 무너뜨린다 (D2)
        local list = self:ListOf(player)
        local count = 0
        for _, rec in ipairs(list) do if rec.kind == kind then count = count + 1 end end
        local i = 1
        while count > keep and i <= #list do
            if list[i].kind == kind then
                self:DestroyEntity(list[i])
                table.remove(list, i)
                count = count - 1
            else
                i = i + 1
            end
        end
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method boolean SpawnUnit(Entity player, table rec, Vector2 pos, any onReady, any onFail)
        local map = player.CurrentMap
        if not isvalid(map) then return false end
        local unit = _SpawnService:SpawnByModelId(_GameConst.ModelShadowUnit, "Undead_" .. rec.kind, Vector3(pos.x, pos.y, 0), map)
        if not isvalid(unit) then return false end
        rec.entity = unit
        local offset = self:FormationOffset(#self:ListOf(player))
        _Util:AfterSpawn(unit, "script.ShadowUnit", function(comp)
            ---@type ShadowUnit
            local u = comp
            u:Setup(player, rec.id, rec.atk, rec.hp, rec.stand, rec.move, offset)
            u.Kind = rec.kind
            u.AttackRUID = rec.attack or ""
            unit.TransformComponent.Scale = Vector3(rec.scale or 1, rec.scale or 1, 1)
            u.AttackCooldown = rec.cooldown
            u.AttackRange = rec.range
            u.Element = rec.element
            u.ElementRatio = rec.ratio
            u.Resists = rec.resists or {}
            u.Variant = rec.variant or ""
            u.ShadowTint = rec.tint
            unit.SpriteRendererComponent.Color = rec.tint
            local mv = unit.MovementComponent
            if isvalid(mv) then mv.InputSpeed = rec.speed end
            if onReady ~= nil then onReady() end
        end, function()
            if isvalid(unit) then unit:Destroy() end
            if onFail ~= nil then onFail() end
        end)
        if rec.expireAt > 0 then
            local id = rec.id
            local delay = math.max(0.1, rec.expireAt - _UtilLogic.ElapsedSeconds)
            _TimerService:SetTimerOnce(function() self:Expire(player, id) end, delay)
        end
        return true
    end

    method Vector2 FormationOffset(integer index)
        -- 주인 둘레 고리 (그림자 대형 바깥쪽)
        local angle = index * 0.9
        local r = 1.6 + (index % 3) * 0.35
        return Vector2(math.cos(angle) * r, math.sin(angle) * r * 0.7)
    end

    -- ───────── 소멸 ─────────

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method void DestroyEntity(table rec)
        if isvalid(rec.entity) then rec.entity:Destroy() end
        rec.entity = nil
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method void Remove(Entity player, string id)
        if not isvalid(player) then return end
        local list = self:ListOf(player)
        for i, rec in ipairs(list) do
            if rec.id == id then
                self:DestroyEntity(rec)
                table.remove(list, i)
                break
            end
        end
        self:RefreshSummary(player)
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method void OnUnitDied(Entity player, string id)
        -- ShadowUnit(Kind ~= shadow)이 쓰러지면 부른다
        self:Remove(player, id)
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method void Expire(Entity player, string id)
        -- 되살림 시간이 끝남
        self:Remove(player, id)
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method void DismissAll(Entity player)
        -- 주인이 죽으면 모두 무너진다 (D2)
        for _, rec in ipairs(self:ListOf(player)) do self:DestroyEntity(rec) end
        self.Owned[player.PlayerComponent.UserId] = {}
        self:RefreshSummary(player)
    end

    -- ───────── 맵 이동 ─────────

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method void Follow(Entity player)
        -- PlayerTravel.Go가 순간이동 직전에 부른다: 지금 엔티티를 지우고, 도착 뒤 같은 능력치로 다시 일으킨다
        local list = self:ListOf(player)
        if #list == 0 then return end
        for _, rec in ipairs(list) do self:DestroyEntity(rec) end
        _TimerService:SetTimerOnce(function()
            if not isvalid(player) then return end
            local now = _UtilLogic.ElapsedSeconds
            local p = _Util:Pos2(player)
            for _, rec in ipairs(self:ListOf(player)) do
                if rec.expireAt == 0 or rec.expireAt > now then self:SpawnUnit(player, rec, p, nil, nil) end
            end
        end, 1.2)
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method integer RallyAll(Entity player, number seconds)
        -- 언데드 집결. 따라온 수
        local n = 0
        for _, rec in ipairs(self:ListOf(player)) do
            if isvalid(rec.entity) then
                ---@type ShadowUnit
                local u = rec.entity:GetComponent("script.ShadowUnit")
                if u ~= nil then
                    u:Rally(seconds)
                    n = n + 1
                end
            end
        end
        return n
    end

    -- ───────── 표시 ─────────

    method integer SkillLevel(Entity player, string id)
        ---@type SkillBook
        local book = player:GetComponent("script.SkillBook")
        if book == nil then return 0 end
        return book:GetLevel(id)
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method void RefreshSummary(Entity player)
        -- 상태줄 "해골 3/4 · 마법사 1/1 · 되살림 2" → ShadowCommander.UndeadSummary (동기화)
        ---@type ShadowCommander
        local cmd = player:GetComponent("script.ShadowCommander")
        if cmd == nil then return end
        local n = { skeleton = 0, mage = 0, revive = 0 }
        for _, rec in ipairs(self:ListOf(player)) do n[rec.kind] = (n[rec.kind] or 0) + 1 end
        local parts = {}
        local sk = self:SkillLevel(player, "raise_skeleton")
        local mg = self:SkillLevel(player, "raise_mage")
        if sk > 0 then table.insert(parts, "해골 " .. tostring(n.skeleton) .. "/" .. tostring(self:CountFor(sk))) end
        if mg > 0 then table.insert(parts, "마법사 " .. tostring(n.mage) .. "/" .. tostring(self:CountFor(mg))) end
        if n.revive > 0 then table.insert(parts, "되살림 " .. tostring(n.revive)) end
        cmd.UndeadSummary = table.concat(parts, " · ")
        cmd.MinionCounts = tostring(n.skeleton) .. "," .. tostring(n.mage) .. "," .. tostring(n.revive)
    end

end
